{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-berkeley-place","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"berkeley-place-ellington-properties-sobha-hartland","about":"Berkeley Place is a residential complex in Mohammed Bin Rashid City (MBR City), next to Meydan Academy Golf Course and Driving Range and 10 minutes drive from the center of Dubai.The complex consists of a first floor with a lobby, two podium levels and 12 residential floors, on which are located apartments with 1 - 2 bedrooms, as well as studios. The finishing of the premises is made in a light color scheme, which together with large panoramic windows creates a bright and cozy interior. Kitchens are equipped with a kitchen island and built-in cabinets with stylish facades in light color. Open balconies with glass enclosures provide unobstructed views from the panoramic windows of the apartments to the lush green parks of the neighborhood.A large landscaped roof level terrace with a luxurious swimming pool and other amenities is available to residents.The building has 2 passenger elevators and 1 service elevator. The complex also has a parking lot and charging stations for electric vehicles. The lobby area includes a lounge area with a library, workspace, concierge desk, and a game room with access to an outdoor terrace. Also on the first floor of the building there is bicycle parking, a basketball court and seating areas surrounded by landscaped gardens. The excellent location of the complex allows its residents to enjoy easy access to any part of the city.","price":2050000,"title":"Berkeley Place","bitrix":{"id":484,"pf_id":"are.2.11878","source":null,"project_id":"Berkeley Place","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Berkeley Place","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Ellington Properties","project_location":"Mohammed Bin Rashid City"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/921/images/2024/02